  "query": "-- A page of the caller's uploads after a cursor's key.\nSELECT\n    upload_id AS \"upload_id: UploadId\",\n    artifact_id AS \"artifact_id: ArtifactId\",\n    creator AS \"creator: StoredPrincipal\",\n    form AS \"form: UploadForm\",\n    state AS \"state: UploadState\",\n    declared_size,\n    max_size,\n    reserved_bytes,\n    object_upload,\n    part_size,\n    created_at,\n    expires_at,\n    ended_at\nFROM artifact.upload\nWHERE tenant = $1 AND creator = $2 AND upload_id < $3\nORDER BY upload_id DESC\nLIMIT $4\n",
